{"seq":2,"slug":"migration-from-android","title":"从 Android 迁移到 HarmonyOS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/ecosystem-and-migration/migration-from-android","wordCount":944,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"从-android-迁移到-harmonyos\">从 Android 迁移到 HarmonyOS</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>随着 HarmonyOS NEXT 生态的成熟，越来越多的 Android 应用面临迁移需求。由于 HarmonyOS NEXT 完全脱离 AOSP，迁移不是简单的适配——而是基于新框架的重新实现。本文提供系统性的迁移方法论，从技术栈映射、架构重设计到具体实施步骤，帮助团队高效完成迁移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[迁移评估] --&gt; B[技术栈映射]&#10;    B --&gt; C[架构设计]&#10;    C --&gt; D[核心模块迁移]&#10;    D --&gt; E[UI 层重写]&#10;    E --&gt; F[测试验证]&#10;    F --&gt; G[性能优化]&#10;    G --&gt; H[上架发布]&#10;&#10;    A --&gt; A1[功能清单梳理]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[三方库依赖分析]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[工期评估]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[语言: Kotlin → ArkTS]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[UI: Compose/View → ArkUI]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[架构: MVVM → 同等]\">flowchart TD\n    A[迁移评估] --&gt; B[技术栈映射]\n    B --&gt; C[架构设计]\n    C --&gt; D[核心模块迁移]\n    D --&gt; E[UI 层重写]\n    E --&gt; F[测试验证]\n    F --&gt; G[性能优化]\n    G --&gt; H[上架发布]\n\n    A --&gt; A1[功能清单梳理]\n    A --&gt; A2[三方库依赖分析]\n    A --&gt; A3[工期评估]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[语言: Kotlin → ArkTS]\n    B --&gt; B2[UI: Compose/View → ArkUI]\n    B --&gt; B3[架构: MVVM → 同等]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Android 到 HarmonyOS 的迁移本质是基于新平台的重新实现，核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不是移植而是重构</strong>：HarmonyOS NEXT 完全脱离 AOSP，需以 ArkUI + Stage 模型思维重写</li>\n<li><strong>分层迁移顺序</strong>：先数据层（网络/数据库）→ 再公共组件库 → 最后逐页迁移</li>\n<li><strong>技术栈映射</strong>：Kotlin→ArkTS、Compose/View→ArkUI、Activity/Fragment→UIAbility+Page</li>\n<li><strong>架构等效</strong>：MVVM 在两端可一一对应，Repository/DataSource 层迁移成本最低</li>\n<li><strong>三方库替代</strong>：多数 Android 三方库有官方或社区替代，部分（如 Dagger）无等效框架</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"技术栈对照表\">技术栈对照表</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Android 技术</th>\n<th>HarmonyOS 对应</th>\n<th>迁移复杂度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kotlin / Java</td>\n<td>ArkTS</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>语法相近但类型约束更严</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jetpack Compose</td>\n<td>ArkUI</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>声明式范式相同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XML View</td>\n<td>ArkUI</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要完全重写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Activity/Fragment</td>\n<td>UIAbility + Page</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Stage 模型更简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service</td>\n<td>ExtensionAbility</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>后台限制更严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ContentProvider</td>\n<td>DataShareExtension</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>概念相似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BroadcastReceiver</td>\n<td>CommonEvent</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>直接对应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Database</td>\n<td>RelationalStore</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>SQL 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SharedPreferences</td>\n<td>Preferences / AppStorage</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>API 更现代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retrofit / OkHttp</td>\n<td>@kit.NetworkKit</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>功能完整但 API 不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Glide / Coil</td>\n<td>Image 组件原生</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>框架内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Navigation Component</td>\n<td>Navigation / Router</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>路由模型不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WorkManager</td>\n<td>WorkSchedulerExtension</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>调度策略不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Firebase Push</td>\n<td>华为 Push Kit</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要接入华为服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"架构迁移策略\">架构迁移策略</h2><h3 id=\"mvvm-架构映射\">MVVM 架构映射</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Android MVVM&#10;        A1[View/Compose] --&gt; A2[ViewModel]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[Repository]&#10;        A3 --&gt; A4[DataSource]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph HarmonyOS 等效&#10;        B1[ArkUI Component] --&gt; B2[ViewModel Class]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[Repository]&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4[DataSource]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A1 -.-&gt;|对应| B1&#10;    A2 -.-&gt;|对应| B2&#10;    A3 -.-&gt;|对应| B3&#10;    A4 -.-&gt;|对应| B4\">graph LR\n    subgraph Android MVVM\n        A1[View/Compose] --&gt; A2[ViewModel]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[Repository]\n        A3 --&gt; A4[DataSource]\n    end\n\n    subgraph HarmonyOS 等效\n        B1[ArkUI Component] --&gt; B2[ViewModel Class]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[Repository]\n        B3 --&gt; B4[DataSource]\n    end\n\n    A1 -.-&gt;|对应| B1\n    A2 -.-&gt;|对应| B2\n    A3 -.-&gt;|对应| B3\n    A4 -.-&gt;|对应| B4</pre><h3 id=\"viewmodel-迁移示例\">ViewModel 迁移示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Android (Kotlin):&#10;// class ArticleViewModel : ViewModel() {&#10;//     private val _articles = MutableStateFlow&lt;List&lt;Article&gt;&gt;(emptyList())&#10;//     val articles: StateFlow&lt;List&lt;Article&gt;&gt; = _articles.asStateFlow()&#10;//     fun loadArticles() { viewModelScope.launch { ... } }&#10;// }&#10;&#10;// HarmonyOS (ArkTS):&#10;@Observed&#10;class ArticleViewModel {&#10;  articles: ArticleInfo[] = []&#10;  isLoading: boolean = false&#10;  errorMessage: string = &#39;&#39;&#10;&#10;  private repository: ArticleRepository = new ArticleRepository()&#10;&#10;  async loadArticles(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    this.isLoading = true&#10;    this.errorMessage = &#39;&#39;&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;      this.articles = await this.repository.getArticles()&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      this.errorMessage = `加载失败: ${(error as Error).message}`&#10;    } finally {&#10;      this.isLoading = false&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async refreshArticles(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    try {&#10;      this.articles = await this.repository.getArticles(true)&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      console.error(`刷新失败: ${error}`)&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 组件中使用&#10;@Entry&#10;@Component&#10;struct ArticlePage {&#10;  @State viewModel: ArticleViewModel = new ArticleViewModel()&#10;&#10;  aboutToAppear(): void {&#10;    this.viewModel.loadArticles()&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  build() {&#10;    Column() {&#10;      if (this.viewModel.isLoading) {&#10;        LoadingProgress().width(48).height(48)&#10;      } else if (this.viewModel.errorMessage) {&#10;        Text(this.viewModel.errorMessage).fontColor(Color.Red)&#10;      } else {&#10;        List() {&#10;          ForEach(this.viewModel.articles, (item: ArticleInfo) =&gt; {&#10;            ListItem() { ArticleCard({ article: item }) }&#10;          }, (item: ArticleInfo) =&gt; item.id)&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Android (Kotlin):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// class ArticleViewModel : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     private val _articles = MutableStateFlow&#x3C;List&#x3C;Article>>(emptyList())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     val articles: StateFlow&#x3C;List&#x3C;Article>> = _articles.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     fun loadArticles() { viewModelScope.launch { ... } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HarmonyOS (ArkTS):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@Observed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArticleViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  articles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArticleInfo</span><span style